# proto-file: contracts/proto/vectra/config.proto
# proto-message: vectra.config.v1.GeohashPolicy
#
# The spatial partitioning contract. Cell sizes at the equator [17] [18];
# widths shrink with cos(latitude).

# ~156 km x 156 km: macro-region / data-center selection.
macro_region_chars: 3
# ~39.1 km x 19.5 km: primary shard key, one node per cell.
shard_chars: 4
# ~4.9 km x 4.9 km: in-node inverted prefilter.
prefilter_chars: 5
# ~1.2 km x 0.6 km: micro-neighborhood bound for pricing features.
microhood_chars: 6

default_radius_km: 5.0
# Static cap. The router also rejects any radius that would reach past the
# eight cells adjacent to the query's cell (19.5 km tall at precision 4), so
# fan-out never exceeds nine cells.
max_radius_km: 15.0
